+	 * drain loops). All writers update ctx->count via WRITE_ONCE() under
+	 * ctx->wqh.lock before calling wake_up_locked_poll(); if a concurrent
+	 * writer increments ctx->count after we read 0, its wakeup fires on
+	 * any registered poll/epoll waiter (zero missed wakeups).
+	 */
